<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Data and Performance Analysis</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Reward Model Dataset</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We detail the dataset used for the reward model, which is sourced from Tencent commercial search engine. Table <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ A.1 Reward Model Dataset ‣ Appendix A Data and Performance Analysis ‣ From Faithfulness to Correctness: Generative Reward Models that Think Critically" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>. includes the number of queries, answers, sentence counts as well as the proportion of correct and incorrect sentences (reported as percentages).</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T3" class="ltx_table">
